  <ul>
    <li>All Popdarts&reg; orders ship next business day.</li>
    <li>Standard shipping in the USA takes 3&ndash;5 business days.</li>
    <li>Returns are easy. Simply contact us at <a href="mailto:support@popdartsgame.com">support@popdartsgame.com</a>.</li>
